        "# Lock-free\n",
        "\n",
        "Lock-free describes an algorithm that guarantees system-wide progress without requiring a lock: even if one thread stalls, some operation can still complete.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-lock-free)"
      ]
    }
  ],
